# Discover is the first screen. A row says whether a book can be had and no
# more -- which library is the book screen's business, because that is where a
# library is chosen -- and a title five people wrote is named by the first of
# them and a count. Then a whole list, paged with buttons at both ends.
clean
expect Prêt numérique
expect Recent releases
expect A. Michaud · Available
expect All copies out
expect Page 1 of 3
expect Previous page
expect Next page
tap Next page
wait-for En août, je lis québécois
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Recent releases
clean
tap See the whole list
wait-for Filters
expect Recent releases
# A title five people wrote is named by the first of them and a count, on one
# line, where the whole list was two.
expect J. Boisvert +4
expect-missing Pierrette Dubé
clean
expect Page 1
tap Next page
wait-for Page 2
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Page 1
clean
tap Mensonges
wait-for Book details
# The book screen exposes each library as the actionable borrow/reserve row.
expect Montréal · Borrow
clean
